    "description": "Stands between the line, the phone and the dining room with busy hands and seconds to spare. Oksana (Sunny Side, ~85% walk-ins) manages up to 15 waiting groups on a clipboard and loses 10–12 tables a shift to walk-aways; Devon (Harbor & Pine, reservations-led) fights 30 calls a day, messy notes, guessed overbooking and Sunday staffing guesswork. Both measure tools by taps and minutes, and both are comfortable paying per SMS because one saved table pays for it.",
